# --- Tubi TV 核心域名 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tubitv.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tubi.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tubi.tv
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tubi.video

# --- Tubi 內容與廣告 (補上 adrise 以免黑屏) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adrise.tv
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,production-public.tubi.io
DOMAIN,manifest.production-public.tubi.io

# --- 如果你使用的是海外版（如澳洲、加拿大），建議補上對應的 CDN ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tensor-cdn.production-public.tubi.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,production-public.tubi.io
DOMAIN,manifest.production-public.tubi.io
DOMAIN,canvas.tubitv.com
DOMAIN,ott-ps4.tubitv.com

# --- Pluto TV 核心域名 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pluto.tv
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,plutotv.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,plutotv.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,plutopreprod.tv

# --- 关键：播放必须域名 (即便它们看起来像追踪器) ---
# tags.tiqcdn.com 必须走代理以加载播放器配置
DOMAIN,tags.tiqcdn.com
# youborafds01.com 负责心跳监测，屏蔽会导致播放 30 秒后中断
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,youborafds01.com

# --- 派拉蒙/维亚康姆基础架构 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,viacom.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cc-dtc.com

# --- 视频分发 (Akamai/AWS) ---
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,pluto-live
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,plutotv-live

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,livetv-fa.tubi.video
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tensor-cdn.production-public.tubi.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,video-previews-cdn.production-public.tubi.io
